  "summary": "I have been anticipating this kit for quite some time since it was leaked. It's tough to decide between this one and the other Nu FF but which comes first will be served first. It didn't disappoint. The building experience might be tiresome with all the nubs (yeah, you have to carefully treat them or they will be annoying later), and the whole 12 funnels. All the pieces came together pretty smooth, I didn't have any trouble working on them during my 5 day building. Except the shoulder armor can be too tight which you may need to loosen the connecting parts a bit. However, the decal included in this model kit is a huge let down... It's mostly irrelevant to the kit itself and doesn't do any justice to this beauty. I had to purchase a separate EVO metallic decal for ver Ka to use it here. Pretty much 95% matching. What's a nice surprise. The base comes with it is quite useful with options and supporting pieces. Love it. This Nu Gundam is newbie friendly as well as satisfying to assemble for experienced ones. I'm mid so I enjoy it a lot. No jokes.",
